    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d192">

                <pb facs="0305" n="272" xml:id="pg272"/>

                <head>192. Telegram From the Station in the Congo to the Central Intelligence
                        Agency<anchor n="1" xml:id="d192-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Leopoldville</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1964-07-31">July 31,
                        1964</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>2163 (In 40340). 1. [former COS] has met with [Identity 1], [Identity 2],
                    [Identity 3], [<hi rendition="#italic">1 line not declassified</hi>] [Mobutu],
                    [Identity 4], [<hi rendition="#italic">name not declassified</hi>], and
                    [Identity 5]. All meetings went extremely well. Sending detailed cables 1 Aug on
                    each meeting.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d192-f2"/> [<hi rendition="#italic">name not
                        declassified</hi>] present for [Identity 5] meeting and [COS] present at
                    numerous meetings with [Identity 3] and [Mobutu] and [Identity 1] [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">cryptonym not declassified</hi>]</p>
                <p>2. [<hi rendition="#italic">5 lines not declassified</hi>] Full details 1
                    Aug.</p>
                <p>[<hi rendition="#italic">4 paragraphs (25 lines) not declassified</hi>]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d192-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d192-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency Files, [<hi rendition="#italic">text not
                        declassified</hi>], Fiche 37, Row 5, Frames 2–3, [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >text not declassified</hi>]. Secret; Immediate. Received at 1805Z.</p>
            </note>
